# LF everywhere. Tests match source text with newline patterns and compare
# generated files byte for byte, so a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true
# (CRLF in the working tree) failed them.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.xz binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.pdf binary
